---
import { menu } from '../data/schema';
const n = menu.negocio;
---
<footer class="relative mt-20 border-t border-oro/30 bg-carbon pb-28">
  <div class="revela mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col items-center gap-5 px-4 pt-12 text-center">
    <img src="/brand/logo-horizontal.webp" width="640" height="246" alt="MAKIZEN Sushi & Mariscos" loading="lazy" class="h-auto w-60" />
    <ul class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 text-[15px]">
      <li><a class="presionable tap inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 px-4 hover:border-oro" href={`tel:${n.telefono}`}>{n.telefonoTexto}</a></li>
      <li><a class="presionable tap inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 px-4 hover:border-oro" href={`tel:${n.telefonoFijo}`}><span lang="es">Domicilio</span><span lang="en">Delivery</span>&nbsp;{n.telefonoFijoTexto}</a></li>
      <li><a class="presionable tap inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 px-4 hover:border-oro" href={n.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a></li>
      <li><a class="presionable tap inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 px-4 hover:border-oro" href={n.facebook} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-[15px] text-niebla"><span lang="es">{n.pago.es}</span><span lang="en">{n.pago.en}</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-2xl px-4 text-center text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-humo">
    <p lang="es">Precios en pesos mexicanos (MXN) con IVA incluido. Etiquetas de picante y crudo: por confirmar con cocina. Fotos: @makizen.puertopenasco.</p>
    <p lang="en">Prices in Mexican pesos (MXN), tax included. USD amounts are an approximate reference only; you pay in MXN. Photos: @makizen.puertopenasco.</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-oro/80">一期一会 · <span lang="es">Buena comida · Buenos momentos · Siempre aquí</span><span lang="en">Good food · Good times · Always here</span></p>
    <p class="mt-2"><span lang="es">Propuesta de menú digital · demo</span><span lang="en">Digital menu proposal · demo</span></p>
  </div>
</footer>
